11. PURE BLUE SELF-COMPLEMENT STRUCTURE:
   For pure blue class C (all tilings grid-sym): what is C's flip-partner?
   The flip-partner of a pure-blue class is always MIXED or PURE-BLUE.
   n=3 ci0(H=1,blue=1): connects to [(1, 'pure_blue')]
   n=3 ci1(H=3,blue=1): connects to [(0, 'pure_blue')]
   n=4 ci0(H=1,blue=1): connects to [(2, 'mixed')]
   n=5 ci0(H=1,blue=1): connects to [(6, 'mixed')]
   n=5 ci3(H=3,blue=1): connects to [(10, 'mixed')]
   n=5 ci11(H=15,blue=3): connects to [(8, 'mixed'), (9, 'mixed'), (10, 'mixed')]
   n=6 ci0(H=1,blue=1): connects to [(22, 'mixed')]
   n=6 ci23(H=9,blue=1): connects to [(12, 'mixed')]
